# What this plugin is, for the index in README.md and for whoever installs
# it alone. One key per line; the Makefile beside it does the installing.
name: xymonapi
version: 2.1.0
side: server, client
summary: a read-only HTTP and JSON interface to a Xymon server, as one of its xymonlaunch tasks, and its client
requires: on the server, xymon >= 4.3.31 (main); python >= 3.9
manual: xymonapi.8
